  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Copper glance :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>;&nbsp;Cuprite :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Malachite :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>CuCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;; Chalcopyrite :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuFeS</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>&nbsp;Malachite is a copper carbonate hydroxide mineral with the formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>CuCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p></blockquote>"
